No project is bound. Call `{{tool_prefix}}set_project` with the absolute repository root.

Run `git rev-parse --git-common-dir`:

- If it returns `.git`, use the current directory as `path`.
- Otherwise, use the parent directory of the returned `.git` path as `path`.

If you are working in a separate worktree, also pass its root as an absolute path as `worktree`.
